eory”.  Narkiewicz held during his career various administrative functions at the University of Wroclaw, including Deputy Head of the Mathematical Institute, Dean of the Faculty of Mathematics and Physics and Vice Rector for Scientific Affairs. In 1968 he was awarded the Stefan Banach Prize.\n\n## Bibliographic Information\n\n  * Book Title: The Story of Algebraic Numbers in the First Half of the 20th Century\n\n  * Book Subtitle: From Hilbert to Tate\n\n  * Authors: Władysław Narkiewicz\n\n  * Series Title: Springer Monographs in Mathematics\n\n  * DOI: https://doi.org/10.1007/978-3-030-03754-3\n\n  * Publisher: Springer Cham\n\n  * eBook Packages: Mathematics and Statistics, Mathematics and Statistics (R0)\n\n  * Copyright Information: Springer Nature Switzerland AG 2018\n\n  * Hardcover ISBN: 978-3-030-03753-6 Published: 29 January 2019\n\n  * eBook ISBN: 978-3-030-03754-3 Published: 18 January 2019\n\n  * Series ISSN: 1439-7382\n\n  * Series E-ISSN: 2196-9922\n\n  * Edition Number: 1\n\n  * Number of Pages: XI, 443\n\n  * Number of Illustrations: 1 b/w illustrations\n\n  * Topics: Number Theory, History of Mathematical Sciences\n\n## Keywords\n\n  * Algebraic Numbers\n  * History of Number Theory\n  * Algebraic Number Theory\n  * 11Rxx\n  * 01A60\n  * 11-03--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nRational number theory in the 20th Century : from PNT to FLT | Wageningen University and Research Library catalog (https://library.wur.nl/WebQuery/titel/2133698)\nciteturn628search6 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: 4 months ago; Title  | Rational number theory in the 20th Century : from PNT to FLT show extra info.Władysław Narkiewicz ... Publisher  | London : Springer ... Rational Number Theory in the 20th Century: From PNT to FLT offers a short survey of 20th century developments in classical number theory, documenting between the proof of the Prime Number Theorem and the proof of Fermat's Last Theorem.\n\nRecord number  | 2133698[Inp