m on approximation of algebraic numbers by rationals. We cover also the apparition of the Tate–Šafarevič group in the theory of elliptic curves, the birth of probabilistic number theory and progress in geometry of numbers (proof of Newton’s conjecture of the kissing problem by K. Schütte and B.L. van der Waerden).\n\n## No full-text available\n\nImage: Request Full-text Paper PDF\n\nTo read the full-text of this research,\nyou can request a copy directly from the author.\n\nRequest full-text PDF\n\n## Citations (0)\n\n## References (705)\n\nResearchGate has not been able to resolve any citations for this publication.--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nIRMA - Narkiewicz, Wladyslaw (https://bibmath.math.unistra.fr/Record.htm?idlist=255&record=19514188157913323609)\nciteturn628search10 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: 3 months ago;   * [MathOuvrage] Rational number theory in the 20th century / Narkiewicz, Wladyslaw. -London : Springer, 2011. - xiv, 654 p. ; 25 cm ...   * [MathOuvrage] Elementary and analytic theory of algebraic numbers / Narkiewicz, Wladyslaw. -Warszawa : PWN-Polish scientific publishers, 1974. - 630 p.\n\n  * Accueil\n  * a\n  * Conférence Moshé Flato 1999. Vol. I\n  * a\n  * Affine Lie algebras and quantum groups\n  * a\n  * Quantum groups and related topics\n  * a\n  * Integrable systems and quantum groups\n  * a\n  * Narkiewicz, Wladyslaw\n\nF x |\n\nL\n\n  * l\n  *   * L\n  *   * o\n\nAuteur\n\nH Narkiewicz, Wladyslaw\n\nDocuments liés : [12 document(s)]\n\n### Documents (Auteurs)\n\n  * [MathOuvrage] The Story of algebraic numbers in the first half of the 20th century / Narkiewicz, Wladyslaw. -Cham : Springer, 2018. - xi, 443 p. ; 25 cm\nISBN 9783030037536\n  * [MathOuvrage] Rational number theory in the 20th century / Narkiewicz, Wladyslaw. -London : Springer, 2011. - xiv, 654 p. ; 25 cm\nISBN 9780857295316\nhttps://link.springer.com/bookseries/3733\n  * [MathOuvrage] Selecta. Vol. II / Schinzel, Andrzej ;